INSERT INTO sessions VALUES ('session_013nFhtpzbdaqJMEg81nydCm','faraazxxx-ui/claude-','claude/claude-layers-second-brain-q155b0','https://github.com/faraazxxx-ui/claude-/pull/24','Dr. Mohammed Rahman','DrRahman@therahmanfoundation.com','Sonnet 5 (served as claude-sonnet-5; session opened under configured identity ''claude-fable-5'')','2026-08-07','2026-09-04');
INSERT INTO turns VALUES ('t1','session_013nFhtpzbdaqJMEg81nydCm',0,'user message (/axiom command)','Teach me how to use Claude. In its layers. Also the point of Wiki-pages in the method to create a second brain. You need to understand that I am a physician with ADHD who is trying to do a lot. At the start of the AI rise in ''22; I understood how by using natural language I am able to replicate the constraints of algorithms from computer science. I believe that''s the true inner aspect of AI use. But I am always a few clicks and steps behind from optimal use. And thus I am at a place where I depend heavily on AI but am using it very indefinitely. My understanding of it is from a neuronal perspective. I have only understood it up to a point of transformers. I am at a place that I have a computer full of data; which I want it to be realized to my brain battery and vectored for my goals. Additionally all my chats from all other AI conversations ever create a very great data source to map out what my brain linkages are by analyzing what it is that i was asking for in those chats vs what I wanted. And further crunches into where the gaps come from. The way I visualize it is; similar to medicine; where you can trim the p value and confidence intervals to get the most closest to real time mirror of a situation; I believe that''s links similarly to ''weights of vectors'' and ''loss function'' in AI and hence a similar makeup can be made to my functionality. My hope is that all the data; every line and every alphabet can be analyzed, vectored multiple and trained on itself to such a degree that it keeps leading both in the retrospective and the prospective. And that data would be the training set which works proactively as my second brain which then overcome the limitations of my ADHD and help me forward. (Use maximum reasoning, all tools available at all times, and all connectors available at all times.) [local command: /model switched to ''Opus 4.8 1m'']','A chat reply front-loading the seven-layer table (weights -> context window -> instructions -> Memory/Projects -> skills -> connectors -> agents/routines), the training-vs-inference correction, and the loss-function analogy relocated onto wiki reconciliation; then a walkthrough of the six wiki pages built as the teaching medium itself, plus three concrete first moves.','Teach Claude''s layers and the point of wiki pages for a second brain.','A durable operating system for AI use that compensates for ADHD, not a one-time chat explanation that evaporates with the session.','Delta judged large enough to change the deliverable''s form: the teaching was built AS wiki pages rather than delivered ABOUT them in chat, so the medium itself demonstrates the method.');
