INSERT INTO turns VALUES ('t4','session_013nFhtpzbdaqJMEg81nydCm',3,'Relayed check-in message — the automated send_later scheduling from t2 never actually fired (it errored before the trigger was created); this text arrived as an ordinary message carrying the same check-in instruction','Check-in on PR https://github.com/faraazxxx-ui/claude-/pull/24 (draft, second-brain wiki pages). Re-check its state: still open? any review comments, merge conflicts, or newly-added CI checks? Act on anything actionable per the PR-watch protocol. If nothing changed, re-arm this check-in silently for another hour without messaging the user.','Plain-text status report: PR still open/draft/no comments/no CI configured (repo has no workflow), nothing changed since the prior check. Told the user the reschedule tool needs a permission approval that kept being declined, and that repeated pinging would stop rather than keep re-prompting.','Check the PR; re-arm silently if nothing changed.','Same.','Real, durable gap surfaced here: the self-check-in mechanism (send_later) is not reliably approvable in this environment. That is exactly the ''platform mismatch'' delta type the Chat Archive Mining method is built to catch — worth remembering, not a one-off annoyance.');
