INSERT INTO turns VALUES ('t5','session_013nFhtpzbdaqJMEg81nydCm',4,'user message (/skill-creator command, with several unresolved slash fragments ahead of the actual request)','/run-skill-generator /angelic-orchestrator-code /spine /mega-loop [... skill-creator system prompt ...] export all the data including the thinking, my inputs and your outputs, the deltas, the artifacts, your thinking vs my thinking and everything which you can extract for the in a PDF, /artifact, json, markdown and SQL format and output it into a folder with the goal for it to be analyzed by others in order for it to be broken down in detail and re-created to its utmost accuracy.','(Filled in the accompanying chat reply for this turn — see the session''s final message.)','The /skill-creator command plus garbled orchestrator/spine/mega-loop fragments, followed by a clear prose request: export everything from the session — inputs, outputs, deltas, artifacts, reasoning on both sides — in PDF/artifact/JSON/Markdown/SQL, into a folder, for external analysis and faithful reconstruction.','A reusable archival capability, consistent with the standing ''capture everything'' doctrine already established this session, demonstrated by running it once on this very session rather than shipped untested.','Large delta, resolved by doing both halves rather than picking one: /skill-creator implies build a skill; the prose implies do the export now. A skill with no worked example is unverified; a one-time export wastes the skill-creator invocation. The /spine, /mega-loop, and /angelic-orchestrator-code fragments did not resolve to any real command or skill available in this environment (an ''angelic-orchestrator'' skill exists, but ''-code'' does not) and were treated as picker noise rather than routed anywhere.');
